INT. DRY-DOCKED FERRY - CAR DECK - NIGHT

Rusted ramps. Oil stink. Four shapes around a stolen hatch.

JUNO KASPAROV (30s, lead). MATTEO "MATS" BIANCHI (40s, driver). PRISCILLA OKAFOR-WELLS (20s, lockpick). HENRIK SVEN (50s, lookout).

JUNO
Mats, headlight cover.

MATS
Done, Juno.

PRISCILLA
Hatch is open. Count of three?

HENRIK
Guard's early. Hear that?

Boots clang above. Everyone drops.

JUNO
Priscilla, in. Now.

PRISCILLA
I'm in, I'm in!

MATS
Henrik, you said clear!

HENRIK
I said clear ten minutes ago!

The boots stop. A radio crackles. Then, laughter, drifting off. Silence.

JUNO
Okay. Nobody breathe. Nobody speak.

MATS
(whispering)
Juno?

JUNO
What?

MATS
You just did.
